{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02813",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.17,
      "end_seconds": 6.31,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "Right then, come on in. Okay, where shall we begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 8.0,
      "end_seconds": 13.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "Mainly I've been losing things. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.99,
      "end_seconds": 18.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.19,
      "end_seconds": 42.56,
      "duration_seconds": 23.37,
      "text": "Probably about a week. Yeah. Oh, and difficulty concentrating. That's been about the same, three weeks. About difficulty concentrating, pretty severe, if I'm being honest. I've also had impatience, for two days. As for impatience, pretty severe, if I'm being honest. Oh, and restlessness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.64,
      "end_seconds": 54.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "What about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.05,
      "end_seconds": 62.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "My aunt has rheumatoid arthritis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.08,
      "end_seconds": 80.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.37,
      "end_seconds": 86.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "Hmm, I had my tonsils removed as a teenager."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.03,
      "end_seconds": 92.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.14,
      "end_seconds": 111.02,
      "duration_seconds": 16.88,
      "text": "I have about eight cigarettes in a day. I'm vegetarian and have been for years. I work in accounts at a hospital. Not much, I mostly stay in these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.63,
      "end_seconds": 116.93,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.33,
      "end_seconds": 135.22,
      "duration_seconds": 12.89,
      "text": "Hmm, there was some antibiotic, I was told I was allergic. But I couldn't tell you what it was called or what it did."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.65,
      "end_seconds": 144.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Alright, what about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.54,
      "end_seconds": 154.96,
      "duration_seconds": 6.42,
      "text": "I have diabetes, for about ten years. Yes, an irregular heartbeat."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.35,
      "end_seconds": 164.17,
      "duration_seconds": 7.82,
      "text": "Alright, an irregular heartbeat, that matches what I have here. Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.77,
      "end_seconds": 168.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Gliclazide, 80 milligrams, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 170.71,
      "end_seconds": 175.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Doctor, our chart from the last visit lists it as 160 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.65,
      "end_seconds": 180.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "Hm, that's different. Is the latest prescription anywhere near you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.17,
      "end_seconds": 191.98,
      "duration_seconds": 9.81,
      "text": "Well, not with me. I'll bring it next time. Warfarin. I take it 3 milligrams, maybe, in the evening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.39,
      "end_seconds": 197.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "Did you happen to bring the box or the paperwork?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.64,
      "end_seconds": 202.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.03,
      "end_seconds": 208.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Have you noticed thoughts of self-harm or drug use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.57,
      "end_seconds": 214.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "No, no thoughts of self-harm or drug use."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.13,
      "end_seconds": 221.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.57,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any low mood or head injury?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.86,
      "end_seconds": 226.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.61,
      "end_seconds": 234.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.19,
      "end_seconds": 237.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.03,
      "end_seconds": 241.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 242.68,
      "end_seconds": 244.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Nothing there, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 245.12,
      "end_seconds": 252.46,
      "duration_seconds": 7.34,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Temp 36.6 degrees, heart rate 80, pressure 121 over 71."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.32,
      "end_seconds": 254.02,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.47,
      "end_seconds": 280.41,
      "duration_seconds": 10.94,
      "text": "From what you've told me, I think we're dealing with possible adult attention deficit disorder at this stage. We shouldn't forget anxiety."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 280.94,
      "end_seconds": 284.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Okay, so do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.59,
      "end_seconds": 301.0,
      "duration_seconds": 15.41,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with possible adult attention deficit disorder do well once it's treated properly. Let's get a questionnaire, for attention problems. A thyroid test is what I'd like next, for poor concentration."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.8,
      "end_seconds": 304.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Is that done today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.92,
      "end_seconds": 332.49,
      "duration_seconds": 26.57,
      "text": "Use lists and reminders while we arrange the specialist assessment. Let's get you seen by the adult ADHD service, I'll arrange the letter. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. If the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please come to the emergency department. I'd like you back after the assessment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 333.15,
      "end_seconds": 336.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "I'll note it in my calendar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.49,
      "end_seconds": 342.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 343.17,
      "end_seconds": 346.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "Right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 348.68,
      "end_seconds": 349.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
